WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:12.140
Sixty-seven games, sorted by kind: arcade,
puzzles, terminal, board games, security, and
toys.

2
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:18.300
Or just type what you want. The list narrows
as you type.

3
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:27.530
Your scores are saved in your own browser, and
the page shows you the actual rows it is
holding — not a description of them.

4
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:34.100
You can clear them in one click. They were
never stored anywhere else.

5
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:42.680
Or turn saving off entirely. The games still
play. They just stop remembering.

